MyLLMos App Gallery — Licence
=============================

Copyright © 2026 Opticell Ltd (United Kingdom). All rights reserved.

This repository is **source-available, not open source**. The source is public
because MyLLM ships a "View code" button and a Remix button, and an app you
cannot read is an app you cannot trust. Being readable is the point. Being
free to take is not.


What you may do
---------------

- **Read it.** Study any app here, in the repository or inside MyLLM.
- **Remix it for yourself.** Modify any app and run your version inside MyLLM,
  including apps you build by editing ours. Keep it, change it, break it.
- **Share what you make with people you know.** Send a modified app to a
  friend, or to someone helping you build it.
- **Quote it.** Short excerpts in tutorials, reviews, articles or forum posts,
  with attribution, are fine and welcome.


What you may not do without written permission
----------------------------------------------

- **Republish these apps**, whole or substantially, anywhere — an app store, a
  gallery, a marketplace, a template pack, a repository presented as your own
  work, or a paid product.
- **Present this work as yours**, or remove the attribution notice at the top
  of a file.
- **Train on this repository** as part of a dataset assembled for redistribution
  or commercial model release.
- **Use the names** "MyLLM", "MyLLMos", "Opticell", or the names, icons and
  banner art of individual apps, for anything that is not this project. Those
  are trade marks and brand assets, and no licence to them is granted here.

Permission for anything on this list is usually available for the asking —
open an issue, or contact us via https://www.opticell-limited.com/myllm.


Third-party components
----------------------

Some apps bundle third-party libraries, which remain under **their own
licences** and are not covered by the terms above. Those licences permit the
use made of them here, and each is listed with its copyright holder in
THIRD-PARTY.md. Nothing in this licence restricts your rights under them.


Community apps
--------------

Apps contributed by other people are owned by their authors, are credited to
them, and are hosted here under the licence described in GALLERY-TERMS.md.
This licence covers Opticell's own apps only.


